### Fetch B001 Books
GET {{server}}/odata/v4/book/FetchBooks(borrowerID='B001')

### Delete Book by ID
DELETE {{server}}/odata/v4/book/Books(79f59353-998f-42b6-8110-f9d2615f6c5e)

### Insert Products
POST {{server}}/odata/v4/northwind/insertTBProducts
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "records": [
        {
            "ProductID": 1,
            "ProductName": "Sample Coffee",
            "SupplierID": 1,
            "CategoryID": 1,
            "QuantityPerUnit": "10 boxes",
            "UnitPrice": 250.00,
            "UnitsInStock": 25,
            "UnitsOnOrder": 5,
            "ReorderLevel": 10,
            "Discontinued": false
        }
    ]
}


### Insert Suppliers
POST {{server}}/odata/v4/northwind/insertTBSuppliers
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "records": [
        {
            "SupplierID": 1,
            "CompanyName": "Sample Beverage Supplier",
            "ContactName": "Sample Contact",
            "ContactTitle": "Sales Representative",
            "Address": "100 Sample Street",
            "City": "Manila",
            "Region": "NCR",
            "PostalCode": "1000",
            "Country": "Philippines",
            "Phone": "02-8123-4567",
            "Fax": null,
            "HomePage": null
        }
    ]
}


### Insert Categories
POST {{server}}/odata/v4/northwind/insertTBCategories
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "records": [
        {
            "CategoryID": 1,
            "CategoryName": "Beverages",
            "Description": "Soft drinks, coffees, teas, beers, and ales"
        },
        {
            "CategoryID": 2,
            "CategoryName": "Condiments",
            "Description": "Sweet and savory sauces and seasonings"
        }
    ]
}


### Fetch Combined Northwind Data
GET {{server}}/odata/v4/northwind/fetchNorthwindData()